<title>USA: Chadmoore Wireless names Zwaik COO.</title>
<headline>Chadmoore Wireless names Zwaik COO.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chadmoore Wireless Group Inc. Tuesday named Jan Steven Zwaik as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, Chadmoore said Zwaik previously worked as Geotek Communications where he was vice president-director, New York Markets.</p>
</text>
